{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18side_level_act18side_01_end","groupId":"act18side","stageId":"act18side_01","title":"闲聊波尔卡","storyCode":"LE-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18side/level_act18side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"d8284b100eb94add0024b77cc2f35a3e6d6b2b0856e7e2e1693f959a29b99ce6","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g5_czernyhome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我在选拔赛上让你们两个出局了，但现在情况有变，你们是《晨暮》的第一候选了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况有变是说？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原定要演奏《晨暮》的那两个人不能参加音乐会了，所以我才找你们过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能参加音乐会......他们出什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那两个人昨天下午跑到酒馆大吃大喝去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来这倒也正常，可是，不知为了什么鸡毛蒜皮的小事，这两个活宝竟然在酒馆里和人打了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果，吹长笛的胳膊骨折，拉大提琴的更厉害，居然摔断了尾椎骨，坐都坐不下去，还趴在床上说自己可以站着拉琴，简直胡闹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好像很惊讶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这实在有些......出人意料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出人意料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，入选的第二天就出这种事，假如这不仅仅是一场偶然的打架斗殴，你就是最大的嫌疑人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是最大的嫌疑人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不——不不不，这事和我毫无瓜葛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是更希望用音乐打动您，而不是对无辜之人拳打脚踢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得倒挺好听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，既然你有钱资助白垩，花钱雇几个人，对你而言应该也轻而易举，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生，我也可以作证，黑键没有做这种事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能作证？你昨天一直盯着他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你盯着他干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不是“他盯着我”，而是我们俩在一起，商量如何让您回心转意啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然直到最后也没商量出什么结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，他说的是真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，那我姑且相信白垩一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢车尔尼先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急着高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说到底，你们是替补上来的，离我的要求还有不小的差距。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤其是黑键，你是拖后腿的那个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我给你们一天时间练习，晚上再到我家来，我来验收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有达到我的最低标准，你们才算是入选了。要不然，我宁可把《晨暮》这首曲子撤掉，明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，请您放心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，白垩，你不是没有大提琴吗？这把琴你先拿回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我真的可以拿吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果今晚你们能达到我的要求，这把琴就是你的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——谢谢，谢谢您！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，回去吧，我也要整理一下自己的思路——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是乌尔苏拉吗？你又忘记带钥匙了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生，我是罗德岛的干员，您可以叫我芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是芙蓉！难道爷爷出了什么状况——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，车尔尼先生，初次见面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他们已经聊完了，你要是有事就带他们走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，爷爷的病情有什么变化吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，放心。你爷爷经过治疗之后，情况已经比较稳定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生，其实我不是来找白垩，而是来找您的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望能了解一下您最近的病情变化，不知道您现在方不方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问我这个干嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近夕照区出现了不少异常好转的感染者，我来夕照区就是为了调查这一现象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，您在夕照区家喻户晓，没准您对整体情况也有一些把握。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我自己一直好得很，至于别人的病情，我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您不是要开告别音乐会吗？一般来说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我需要一个安静的环境，现在能请你离开了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是哪位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，开开门，咱忘记带钥匙啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白垩，能不能麻烦你再去开个门？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老奶奶，您拎了好多东西啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好孩子，快去屋里坐着，咱自己就能拿得动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，我来帮您把东西送到厨房！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔苏拉，我的远房亲戚。我一直受她照顾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家里来了这么多客人，这可不多见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位怕不是贵族老爷？这可真是失礼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢当。您要是愿意，可以直接叫我黑键。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这样的贵族，就别和咱老婆子开玩笑啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不是玩笑，您叫我黑键就可以了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就请您恕咱无礼啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔苏拉婆婆，您好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，怎么是萨卡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呸，呸！姑娘，咱只是嘴快，没别的意思，别往心里去啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，乌尔苏拉婆婆，我已经习惯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，咱还是得给你道个歉......对不住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来找先生有什么事啊？也是音乐会的事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不是。我来是想问一下，车尔尼先生的病情有没有什么变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是医生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是罗德岛的干员，您可以叫我芙蓉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你和行板是同事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行板是本地干员，我是从本舰来维谢海姆出差的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那咱就放心啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生和咱的药都是行板给配的，夕照区有不少人都从罗德岛拿药呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生这几天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，人家毕竟是医生，医生关心你的身体，这是好事呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我又没请她来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就不对了，你不请她，她也进不来呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从去年开始，先生的身体就一直不怎么好，一直到今年初春都是这样，要不然，也不会想着办什么告别音乐会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是从昨天开始，先生看起来反而好了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有其他情况吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让咱想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔苏拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好，咱不说啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常感谢您的协助，乌尔苏拉婆婆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果车尔尼先生有什么情况，还请您告诉我一声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算没有这句话，要是出了什么事，咱也得去拜托你们罗德岛呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聊完了？高兴了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聊完啦——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌尔苏拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_489_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呀，瞧咱这记性，说着要做土豆汤，却忘了买土豆......咱再去一趟市场！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（几乎冒出火来的眼神）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——乌尔苏拉婆婆，我也和您一起去市场！我想向您请教一些烹饪上的问题！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，既然大家都走了，我们也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"车尔尼先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车尔尼","speakerId":"avg_4047_pianst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......钥匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌尔苏拉婆婆，钥匙，您的钥匙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g2_slumstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼、呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真没想到一个老太太也能走这么快，我差点追不上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才多亏有你帮我打圆场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，我相信你不会为了入选做那种事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在钥匙也送过去了，我们也该在夕照区找个地方练习了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能像大家一样，直接在街上演奏吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们是练习，又不是卖艺，街上太嘈杂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你家怎么样？正巧你爷爷也搬出去了，我每天从高庭区走过来也累得要死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能拜托你给我腾一张床，我这段时间就住你家里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是很欢迎，可我家太破，我怕你住不习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"会习惯的，会习惯的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g6_whitehome"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里就是我家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（房间太小，窗户漏风，木料发霉，隔音几乎等于没有......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，挺好的，挺好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等下，这里只有一张单人床。你爷爷睡哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爷爷睡床，我打地铺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......这不就是一张地毯吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地毯也挺好的，我也已经睡习惯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你要在这儿住，我就接着打地铺，没问题的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是先练习吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我在波音这里卡住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我们从上一行最后一个小节重新开始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是这个波音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这一段放慢一点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，一个装饰音而已。我就是有点犹豫了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——又是这儿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑键，我把速度放慢，别再纠结这个装饰音了，用单音带过去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"标记就写在谱上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是为了给这个波音做准备，你连前面一段的气息都不稳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，完整地合了一遍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那个装饰音我没吹，车尔尼肯定听得出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系的，我们还有时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"话是这么说，可按照现在这个状态，你已经用不着接着练了，只有我还得继续花时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有，我其实也有处理不好的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看这里，其实是有强弱对比的，我刚刚没表现出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还真是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一些地方我处理得也很勉强，要说熟悉还早呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可吓了我一跳，我还以为你已经彻底练熟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白垩","speakerId":"avg_npc_482_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，时间这么短，想一次性练熟也不太可能，很多东西是要慢慢来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑键","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先休息一会儿吧，之后我们再去抠细节。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越过高高的山岗，恶魔踏入黄昏的中央。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血中的恶疾隐伏，款款招来蔓延的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虫自阴暗中涌出，肆意喷吐毁灭的前奏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终曲的合奏消散，灾祸带走最后的阳光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的改法，您意下如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"和之前的版本也差不多。你确信这个预言能赶走罗德岛的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光是预言可能不够，但要是加上陛下的名号，再以此为由头引发一点小小的骚动......成功的可能性就会很大，不成功也没什么坏处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能确保预言流传的范围局限在夕照区内部吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格特鲁德","speakerId":"avg_npc_484_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请您放心，之前小规模散布的预言并没有扩散的迹象；再者，作为感染者聚居区——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就去做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
